(7754028, 1282290, 75585, '<td valign="top">I am a VERY rare 10 voter - but this is simply Devine! TEN - TEN - TEN!  No highlights are blown, conveys great emotion and movement; it has EVERYTHING that a silhouette needs to be effective in my opinion, it tells a story with little detail.  That is awesome!  Congratulations on what I assume should be a blue ribbon!!</td>', 'I am a VERY rare 10 voter - but this is simply Devine! TEN - TEN - TEN!  No highlights are blown, conveys great emotion and movement; it has EVERYTHING that a silhouette needs to be effective in my opinion, it tells a story with little detail.  That is awesome!  Congratulations on what I assume should be a blue ribbon!!', '2023-07-13 14:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7754094, 1282290, 163081, '<td valign="top">The overall effect of the image is one of tension and excitement. The viewer is drawn into the scene and left wondering what will happen next. The minimalist style of the image only serves to heighten the sense of drama, and the use of color is incredibly effective. This is the clear winner in this contest. And it would in any contest. <br/>I guess it''s Neat. (if not, consider it a compliment). Anyhow a big fat 10 from me.</td>', 'The overall effect of the image is one of tension and excitement. The viewer is drawn into the scene and left wondering what will happen next. The minimalist style of the image only serves to heighten the sense of drama, and the use of color is incredibly effective. This is the clear winner in this contest. And it would in any contest. I guess it''s Neat. (if not, consider it a compliment). Anyhow a big fat 10 from me.', '2023-07-14 07:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
