(7754371, 1282447, 50864, '<td valign="top">This one keeps getting higher every time I look at it. My first instinct when I see 2 crosses and an American flag in one image is to be very uncomfortable. If an image can cause that much feeling then it is worth paying attention to. Sadly, this is accurate for parts of America. I am bumping again. This looks like it could have been one of Robert Franks images in The Americans and he didnt like a lot of what he saw. Bump again :-).</td>', 'This one keeps getting higher every time I look at it. My first instinct when I see 2 crosses and an American flag in one image is to be very uncomfortable. If an image can cause that much feeling then it is worth paying attention to. Sadly, this is accurate for parts of America. I am bumping again. This looks like it could have been one of Robert Franks images in The Americans and he didnt like a lot of what he saw. Bump again :-).', '2023-07-18 14:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
